    {
      "displayText": "Each series of Pokémon utility holes has a theme.\nThe Rouge District’s theme is “determination.”<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nFemale Pyroar are just perfect to represent that!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
