      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 154
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In case you’re curious, the theme in the Vert\nDistrict is supposed to be “camaraderie.”<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThe Bleu District’s theme is said to be “modesty,”\nMagenta should be “grace,” and Jaune, “joviality.”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
